{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:24bf81f33f973d09","name":"Internal Generator","source":{"id":"source:reference-24bf81f33f973d09","title":"Internal Generator","revision":19692,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:26:00Z","sha256":"3e4436120f221b18c5009acf8a11f67f4870093b7b2c73182859afc7f96fd6de","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19692","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Internal%20Generator&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-24bf81f33f973d09","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A miniaturized version of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Generator","referenceId":"reference:bbf4ffdc29b0d2b7"},", an Internal Generator can provide continuous power for different Upgrades on a suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},", including any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Integrated Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Integrated_Equipment","referenceId":"reference:3f482f55a9a8aa19"},". The Internal Generator can be activated or deactivated as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". As long as it's active, an Internal Generator can simultaneously power up to ten different devices that have negligible power requirements (anything without a listed duration).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["For devices with specific power requirements, an Internal Generator can store four units of energy (each the equivalent of an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"},", or 20 rounds of power from a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Generator","referenceId":"reference:bbf4ffdc29b0d2b7"},"), and it automatically recharges one such unit every hour. A suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," can receive this Upgrade multiple times if more energy capacity is needed, but each Internal Generator adds 10 kg to the weight of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},". \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The biggest drawback to an Internal Generator is its energy signature. If the Internal Generator powers anything but devices with negligible power requirements, any character attempting to detect the wearer with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sensor Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sensor_Pack","referenceId":"reference:0d0f0cdf6870cb1b"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Sensors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Sensors"}," gains a +5 circumstance bonus on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
